        },
        {
          "text": " Yaabingwa omu bantu, omutima gwe gwahinduka nk'ogw'enyamaishwa, yaatuura n'enturegye, yaarya obunyaatsi nk'ente, n'omubiri gwe gwaguma nigutondwaho orume orurikuruga omu iguru, okuhitsya obu yaamanyire ngu Ruhanga orikukira boona niwe ategyeka obugabe bw'abantu, kandi akabwemekamu ou arikwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.21",
